WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,020
I really don’t need money anymore

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:03,020
Endless spending

3
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,020
The company has more headaches

4
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:07,020
So soft and so busy that your feet won’t stick to the ground

5
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:11,360
Two accountants chase me every day to ask me to sign this or that.

6
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,360
That Director Chen

7
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:15,360
I want the whole private jet

8
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,360
Both fixed definition and helicopter want

9
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,030
Can it be done?

10
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:20,030
Do it. Why can't you do it?

11
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:23,030
This kid finally remembered to spend money

12
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:25,030
The biggest sum he spent during this period

13
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:29,380
It was a fraud who bought a rooftop equipped with a computer and used it as a yacht.

14
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:31,450
Do you want me to get it done together?

15
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:34,670
Isn’t it true that yachts are very expensive?

16
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:36,670
