17
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:39,900
Can your aircraft mechanics be recruited from the public?

18
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:40,900
What should I do if my hands and feet are tampered with?

19
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:44,960
At the private airport, people from the army are doing maintenance shifts.

20
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,340
Yacht parking private post

21
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,340
Maintained by a professional team at sea

22
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:52,720
So it’s a hell of a cost to you

23
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,170
Pick it yourself

24
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:56,170
It's not easy to buy. I go to the special channel street.

25
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:58,490
When the time comes, I’ll get it remodeled first.

26
00:00:58,490 --> 00:00:59,490
Safety first

27
00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:01,490
All escape devices must be equipped with rides
